      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040423,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而让这一切成为可能的，果然还是“她”吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404230360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040423038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040423,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "评审C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是啊，太过醒目了。/n我的眼力还没衰退到会漏掉那种光芒。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404230370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040423039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040423,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "评审A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没错……对剧团炽热的感情与深厚的信赖，/n以及仿佛角色亲临现场般，将角色真正降临的演技才能。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404230380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040423040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040423,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "评审B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那份光芒不仅照亮她自己，还照亮了身边的演员……。/n所以才有那样的完成度吧。各位觉得呢？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404230390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040423041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040423,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "评审C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "彼此的光芒产生相乘效果，提升了整个舞台的质量……。/n真是个未来不可限量的存在。当然，是好的意义上。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404230400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
